      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "First Shaughnessy, the older section, is bordered by 16th Avenue, King Edward Avenue, Oak Street, and East Boulevard, and is considered the most prestigious part.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
