      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The neighbourhood’s tree‑lined streets and large properties give it a distinctive historic charm that attracts affluent families, professionals, and retirees.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
